          {
            "title": "Example: Syntax",
            "id": 91813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige den Codeblock, damit er frei von Syntaxfehlern ist.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"member = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" member \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Happy Birthday, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + member)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"member\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Happy Birthday, Jason\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>[</code>, gefolgt von <code>]</code> und schließlich <code>print</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prüfe die Zugehörigkeit zu einer Liste. Gib <code>Happy Birthday, Jason</code> aus, ohne eine Benutzereingabe anzufordern.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"member = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" member \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Happy Birthday, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + member)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"member\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"input\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Happy Birthday, Jason\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>[</code>, gefolgt von <code>]</code>, <code>print</code>, <code>(</code> und schließlich <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91806,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Warum löst der folgende Code einen <code>IndexError</code> aus?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"180\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores[\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 2, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    scores[5]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Der Index ist außerhalb des Bereichs</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores</code> ist undefiniert</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores</code> ist kein Dictionary</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Der Index ist außerhalb des Bereichs.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher Ausdruck greift ohne <code>IndexError</code> auf die letzte Punktzahl, <code>180</code>, zu?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"180\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores[\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 2, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    scores[5]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>scores[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores[180]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>scores[2]</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Symbols",
            "id": 91817,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Schreibe eine Anweisung, die nicht zu einem Fehler führt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_a = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_b = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team_a &gt; team_b:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Team A won the game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Team A won the game\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>=</code>, gefolgt von <code>=</code> und schließlich <code>&gt;</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib <code>Team A won the game</code> nur aus, wenn <code>team_a</code> eine höhere Punktzahl als <code>team_b</code> hat.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_a = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_b = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team_a &gt; team_b:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Team A won the game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Team A won the game\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>=</code>, gefolgt von <code>=</code>, <code>&gt;</code> und schließlich <code>print</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Art von Fehler wird der folgende Code verursachen?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"maximum = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;50&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" &lt; maximum: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;OK&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") \" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if &quot;50&quot; &lt; maximum:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"TypeError: &quot;&lt;&quot; not supported between instances of &quot;str&quot; and &quot;int&quot;\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>TypeError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>NameError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>TypeError</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was passiert beim Ausführen des Codes, wenn du <code>\"50\"</code> durch <code>50</code> ersetzt?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"maximum = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;50&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" &lt; maximum: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;OK&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") \" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if &quot;50&quot; &lt; maximum:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"TypeError: &quot;&lt;&quot; not supported between instances of &quot;str&quot; and &quot;int&quot;\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Er wird beendet, ohne etwas auszugeben.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Er gibt OK aus.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Er löst weiterhin einen TypeError aus.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Er löst einen NameError aus.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Er wird beendet, ohne etwas auszugeben.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wo im folgenden Code wird der <code>SyntaxError</code> identifiziert?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"table_size = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tables_required)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                             ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>tables_required = guests table_size</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>guests = 24</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(tables_required)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>tables_required = guests table_size</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Ersetzung für die dritte Zeile beseitigt den <code>SyntaxError</code> und berechnet die Anzahl der Tische?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"table_size = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tables_required)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                             ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>tables_required = guests / table_size</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>tables_required = guests table_size</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>tables_required = guests + \"table_size\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>tables_required = guests / table_size</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: the `else` keyword",
            "id": 92548,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Drucke die Nachricht nur, wenn die Berechnung durchgeführt werden kann.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"people = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / people\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Your share is \" /><text value=\"{str(share)}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" units.&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"raise\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"finally\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your share is 0.5 units.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>pass</code>, gefolgt von <code>else</code> und schließlich <code>prin</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Teile die Gesamtsumme unter den Personen auf. Behandle einen Fehlschlag ohne Fehler und gib die Nachricht nur nach Erfolg aus.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"people = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / people\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Your share is \" /><text value=\"{str(share)}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" units.&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"raise\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"finally\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your share is 0.5 units.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>/</code>, gefolgt von <code>pass</code>, <code>else</code> und schließlich <code>print</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Raise an exception",
            "id": 91239,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie können wir eine Ausnahme auslösen, bei der wir die Fehlermeldung definieren?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>raise Exception</code> gefolgt von einem String, der die Nachricht in Klammern enthält</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Verwenden einer <code>print()</code>-Anweisung</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Mit dem <code>except</code>-Schlüsselwort</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>raise Exception</code> gefolgt von einem String, der die Nachricht in Klammern enthält.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir definieren eine Ausnahmemeldung, indem wir ihren String in <code>raise Exception(...)</code> setzen.</p><p>Welche Zeile löst eine Ausnahme mit der Meldung <code>Invalid age</code> aus?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>raise Exception(\"Invalid age\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(\"Invalid age\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except \"Invalid age\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>raise Exception(\"Invalid age\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Data validation",
            "id": 91909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Art von Fehler könnten wir auslösen, wenn ein Eingabewert für unser Programm nicht geeignet ist?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>NameError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>ValueError</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein Programm erhält das Alter <code>-4</code>. Die Eingabe ist vorhanden, aber ungeeignet. Welchen Fehler sollte es auslösen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError</code>, weil der Wert ungültig ist.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>NameError</code>, weil die Variable für das Alter keinen Wert hat.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code>, weil die Eingabe gegen die Python-Syntax verstößt.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ValueError</code>, weil der Wert ungültig ist.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: the `else` keyword",
            "id": 92542,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird der folgende Codeblock ausgeben?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"trips = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" / \" /><text value=\"&quot;Berlin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"raise\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  trips += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(trips)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 7, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    raise ValueError(&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ValueError: Calculation not possible\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Berlin</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird der folgende Codeblock ausgeben?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"trips = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" / \" /><text value=\"&quot;Berlin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"raise\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  trips += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(trips)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 7, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    raise ValueError(&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ValueError: Calculation not possible\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Berlin</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>Calculation not possible</code> ohne Angabe des Ausnahmetyps</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: the `finally` keyword",
            "id": 92550,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Füge den <code>except</code>-Zweig zu diesem Code hinzu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ellie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Rachel&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Aubrey&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"user = \" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  users.index(user)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Welcome back, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + user)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Do you want to become a member?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"finally\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;See our web site for offers for both members and non-member.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"126\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Welcome back, John\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"See our web site for offers for both members and non-member.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>except</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
